<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>Tactile ≠ auxiliary modality</td>
<td>It's fundamental to the perception-action loop, not a supplement to vision</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>Four-stage pipeline</td>
<td>Transduction → Modality-specific encoding → Cross-modal fusion → Embodied decoding</td>
</tr>
